  "_occ:Stuðningsfulltrúi í grunnskóla og listfræðinemi": "Teaching assistant in primary school and art history student",
  "akranes.B.agenda.0.text": "Let’s bring jobs home. Prepare sites for high-tech industry in Grjótkelduflói and promote the Green Industrial Park in Flóahverfi. Complete the discussions on bringing primary healthcare, state institutions and the municipal offices together under one roof (a town hall at Sementsreitur), as well as an emergency response centre for the fire brigade, police and ambulance services. Work toward successful cooperation with Brim on Breið and the next phase of Akraneshöfn in collaboration with Faxaflóahafnir. Put Akranes on the hotel map — one hotel is only the beginning. Be ready to seize the opportunities created by the arrival of Sundabraut.",
  "akranes.B.agenda.0.title": "Business and value creation",
  "akranes.B.agenda.1.text": "Ensure sustainable operations by strengthening revenue sources and targeted job creation. Remain competitive in the levying of property charges. Coordinate procurement, make use of digital solutions and open up the municipality’s accounts. Establish an infrastructure fund that uses dividends from Faxaflóahafnir and Orkuveitan for infrastructure — not for day-to-day operations.",
  "akranes.B.agenda.1.title": "Sustainable operations, digital development and open dialogue",
  "akranes.B.agenda.2.text": "Guarantee preschool places from 12 months of age with an extension and a new preschool in lower Skagi. Bridge the gap with home-care payments from the end of parental leave until a preschool place is available. Raise the leisure grant to ISK 85,000 during the term and review the age criteria. Begin the discussion on a new compulsory school, safeguard school sites and reorganise the work-school programme for 8th–10th grade. Strengthen youth counselling and community centre activities.",
  "akranes.B.agenda.2.title": "Family affairs and schools",
  "akranes.B.agenda.3.text": "Establish short-term respite care in Akranes for children and young people with support needs, in cooperation with municipalities in Vesturland. Develop a comprehensive policy on disability affairs in Vesturland and build a new supported housing unit. Ensure a safe working environment for Fjöliðjan. Strengthen primary healthcare by moving it into a new town hall at Sementsreitur and secure 60 additional nursing and respite care spaces through the expansion of Höfði. Improve services for people with dementia and modernise home support with welfare technology.",
  "akranes.B.agenda.3.title": "A thriving community and welfare",
  "akranes.B.agenda.4.text": "Complete the planning and begin construction of a 50-metre indoor swimming pool and an upgraded leisure pool with new water slides. Build a new artificial turf pitch on the eastern side of Akraneshöll. Work on a long-term plan for the main football pitch and on expanding Garðavöllur to 27 holes. Shape Akranes’s sports and public health policy, strengthen a health-promoting community with marked walking and running routes, and support organised community activities such as the Scout Movement and the Rescue Society.",
  "akranes.B.agenda.4.title": "Sports and public health",
  "akranes.B.agenda.5.text": "Break the deadlock in planning matters: complete Ægisbraut, Skógarhverfi, Grjótkelduflói, Smiðjuvellir and Breið; begin planning in Akrakotsland and from Kalmansvík to Innsta-vogur. Promote progress on Vesturlandsvegur, new Hvalfjarðargöng and Sundabraut. Raise sea defences in cooperation with Vegagerðin. Publish a scheduled 10-year street maintenance plan. Develop a comprehensive path system, complete the design of the coastal path and restore Garðalundur to its proper standing. Strengthen the campsite and the development of small cabins.",
  "akranes.B.agenda.5.title": "A planning and environmental accord",
  "akranes.B.list.1.bio": "Ragnar Baldvin Sæmundsson is a shop worker and municipal councillor in Akranes. He has served on the Akranes municipal council for Framsókn og frjálsir since 2022 — when he was the lead candidate of the list — and serves as 2nd deputy president of the council during the current term.",
  "akranes.B.list.1.occupation": "Town Councillor",
