  "akranes.B.list.18.occupation": "Candidate",
  "akranes.B.list.2.bio": "Liv Aase Skarstad is a project manager and municipal councillor in Akranes. She has served on the Akranes municipal council for Framsókn og frjálsir since 2022 and has built up experience of cooperation with the neighboring municipality of Hvalfjarðarsveit during the term. She has spoken publicly about relations between the municipalities and emphasized careful and constructive dialogue between local governments instead of merger discussions. Liv Aase holds 2nd place on the list of Framsókn og frjálsir in Akranes in the 2026 municipal elections.",
  "akranes.B.list.2.occupation": "Town Councillor",
  "akranes.B.list.3.occupation": "Managing Director and Town Councillor",
  "akranes.B.list.4.occupation": "Specialist",
  "akranes.B.list.5.occupation": "Head Nurse in Primary Healthcare",
