  "borgarbyggd.M.list.2.occupation": "Labourer",
  "borgarbyggd.M.list.3.bio": "Tinna Rut Þórarinsdóttir is a hotel operator and hairdresser. She is in 3rd place on the Centre Party candidate list in Borgarbyggð for the 2026 municipal elections.",
