  "borgarbyggd.M.list.4.bio": "Helena Rós Helgadóttir is an employee of JGR umboð og heildverslun. She is in 4th place on the Centre Party candidate list in Borgarbyggð for the 2026 municipal elections.",
  "borgarbyggd.M.list.4.occupation": "General staff at JGR office",
  "borgarbyggd.M.list.5.bio": "Hafsteinn Ingi Gunnarsson is a master carpenter. He is in 5th place on the Centre Party candidate list in Borgarbyggð for the 2026 municipal elections.",
