  "borgarbyggd.M.list.7.occupation": "Farmer",
  "borgarbyggd.M.list.8.bio": "Sigurjón Helgason is a farmer and is in 8th place on the Centre Party list in Borgarbyggð for the 2026 municipal elections. The list was introduced at Hótel Vesturlandi in April 2026.",
  "borgarbyggd.M.list.8.occupation": "Farmer",
  "borgarbyggd.M.list.9.bio": "Einar Ólafsson is a machinery contractor, carpenter and fox hunter and is in 9th place on the Centre Party list in Borgarbyggð for the 2026 municipal elections. The candidate list was introduced at Hótel Vesturlandi and published in Skessuhorn in April 2026.",
