  "fjallabyggd.S.agenda.2.title": "Education",
  "fjallabyggd.S.list.1.bio": "Jóhann K. Jóhannsson is the fire chief of Fjallabyggð and leads the S-list of the Social Democratic Association of Fjallabyggð and independents in the 2026 municipal elections. He is originally from Breiðholt in Reykjavík and began his career as a firefighter and paramedic in 2005. He later worked as a reporter and television presenter for Stöð 2, Vísir and Bylgjan. Jóhann lives in Siglufjörður with his family.",
