  "grindavik.B.list.2.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.B.list.4.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.B.list.5.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.B.list.6.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.B.list.7.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.B.list.8.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.B.list.9.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.B.tagline": "Ásrún Helga Kristinsdóttir leads Framsókn in Grindavík",
  "grindavik.D.agenda.0.text": "Professional and transparent governance of Grindavík.",
  "grindavik.D.agenda.0.title": "Administration",
  "grindavik.D.agenda.1.text": "Development and reconstruction of the town.",
  "grindavik.D.agenda.1.title": "Development",
  "grindavik.D.agenda.2.text": "Responsible financial management.",
  "grindavik.D.agenda.2.title": "Finance",
  "grindavik.D.list.1.bio": "Guðbjörg Eyjólfsdóttir is chair of Járngerð, a civic organisation for the reconstruction and future of Grindavík, elected in March 2025. She is in 1st place on the D-list of the Independence Party in Grindavík.",
  "grindavik.D.list.1.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.10.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.11.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.12.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.13.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.14.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.2.occupation": "Police officer",
  "grindavik.D.list.4.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.5.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.6.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.7.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.8.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.list.9.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.D.tagline": "Guðbjörg Eyjólfsdóttir leads the Independence Party in Grindavík",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.0.text": "Strong emphasis on cooperation with the real estate company Þórkatla so that Grindvíkingar have the opportunity to return home. We call for predictability, changes to the legislation on property charges for Þórkatla’s properties, and an extension of the right of first refusal, as well as requesting that lot maintenance be taken care of so the town becomes more attractive.",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.0.title": "Rebuilding and cooperation with Þórkatla",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.1.text": "Insurance and financing for housing, along with business investment, must be secured.",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.1.title": "Insurance and financing for business",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.2.text": "We need to ensure electricity delivery through a loop connection to Reykjanesvirkjun.",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.2.title": "Ensure electricity delivery",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.3.text": "Continue the current town council’s policy of opening schools and preschools this year with safety as the top priority. A 50% discount on preschool fees in the first year for parents who move back home, leisure grants for children, and continued support for sports activities.",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.3.title": "Schools, preschools and leisure activities",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.4.text": "Develop parking areas at popular tourist stops and collect parking fees. Use Hópið as an exhibition site for tourists who want to view the fissure, with the possibility of turning it into a museum telling the story of the earthquakes and volcanic eruptions.",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.4.title": "Tourism, parking and Hópið",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.5.text": "Compensation from NTÍ should be used for investments that improve services for residents, not for operations. Ensure secure follow-up and oversight of the town’s new developments so mistakes are not repeated after the disasters.",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.5.title": "Safer and more responsible financial management",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.6.text": "We want to make Víkurbraut a one-way street while also making it a pedestrian street.",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.6.title": "Víkurbraut as a one-way street and pedestrian street",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.7.text": "Increase the number of family events in town, renovate the playground on Ásabraut for the youngest children, and install an obstacle course in Selskógur similar to the one in Njarðvíkurskógar.",
  "grindavik.M.agenda.7.title": "Family events and play areas",
  "grindavik.M.list.1.bio": "Magnús Már Jakobsson is the chairman of the Grindavík Workers' Union and leads the Centre Party's M-list in Grindavík in the 2026 municipal elections.",
  "grindavik.M.list.1.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.10.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.11.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.2.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.3.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.4.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.5.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.6.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.7.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.8.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.list.9.occupation": "Candidate",
  "grindavik.M.tagline": "Rebuilding Grindavík — the Centre Party in good cooperation",
  "grundarfjordur.GFB.agenda.0.text": "Strengthen the fisheries sector and ensure stable income and employment in the town.",
  "grundarfjordur.GFB.agenda.0.title": "Fisheries",
