  "hrunamannahreppur.D.list.1.bio": "Jón Bjarnason is a farmer at Skipholt in Hrunamannahreppur, an agricultural scientist, contractor, and tourism and sheep farmer. He serves on the municipal council of Hrunamannahreppur and is the leader of the D-list of Independence Party members and independents. He leads the Independence Party list in the 2026 municipal elections.",
