  "hrunamannahreppur.HRL.agenda.2.title": "Innovation",
  "hrunamannahreppur.HRL.list.1.bio": "Daði Geir Samúelsson is the operations manager and chief financial officer of Sólskin, a greenhouse and agricultural company in Flúðir that has grown tomatoes and cucumbers since 1944. He was raised in Hrunamannahreppur and leads the L-list in the 2026 municipal elections, where he already serves as a full member of the municipal council for the L-list.",
