  "hunathing.B.list.1.bio": "Sigurður Líndal Þórison is the managing director of the Icelandic Seal Center in Hvammstangi and leads the list of the Progressive Party and other progressives in Húnaþing vestra in the 2026 municipal elections. He was born and raised at Lækjamót in Víðidalur and now lives in Hvammstangi. Sigurður trained as an actor at ArtsEd in London and holds a master's degree in cultural management from Birkbeck, University of London. He has extensive experience in cultural affairs, innovation, regional development, and business operations, including serving as a managing director at a large company abroad.",
