  "hunathing.D.list.1.bio": "Örn Arnarson is a managing director and leads the D-list of the Independence Party and independents in Húnaþing vestra in the 2026 municipal elections. He lives in Laugarbakki and takes over the top spot on the list from Magnús Magnússon, who moves to third place.",
