  "hunathing.NHV.list.1.bio": "Viktor Ingi Jónsson is a teacher at Grunnskóli Húnaþings vestra and an alternate municipal councillor since 2022, and he leads the N-list in the 2026 municipal elections. He holds a B.Ed. in education from the University of Akureyri, completed his matriculation examination at Kvennaskólinn in Reykjavík, and is pursuing teacher certification studies at HA. He previously worked as a support staff member at the school and at the Óríon youth center (2019–2023) and has coached youth football teams at Kormákur since 2018. He served on the municipality’s youth council from 2019 to 2021. Viktor lives in Hvammstangi with his partner, Dagrún Sól Barkardóttir, and they have one son.",
