  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.agenda.0.text": "Maintain a low municipal income tax rate for residents, lower than in most municipalities in the country.",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.agenda.0.title": "Low municipal tax rate",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.agenda.1.text": "Establish a new community centre and sports hall in Heiðarborg to serve residents.",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.agenda.1.title": "Community centre and sports hall",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.agenda.2.text": "Build a preschool on Innnesið at Krossland to meet the needs of residents in the area.",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.agenda.2.title": "Preschool on Innnesið",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.agenda.3.text": "Correct unfairness in the housing situation of young people so that more people can establish homes in the municipality.",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.agenda.3.title": "Housing issues of young people",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.list.1.bio": "Haraldur Benediktsson is a farmer at Eystri-Reyn in Akraneskaupstaður, below Akrafjall, and a former member of Alþingi and mayor of Akraneskaupstaður. He served in Alþingi for the Independence Party in the Northwest Constituency for ten years and sat, among other things, on the Industry Committee, the Budget Committee, and the Constitutional and Supervisory Committee. Haraldur was appointed mayor of Akraneskaupstaður in 2023 but stepped down from that post in spring 2026 to run for the municipal council in Hvalfjarðarsveit, where he leads the A-list of Samhent sveit in the municipal elections on 16 May 2026. He has chaired numerous committees on behalf of the Farmers Association of Iceland.",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.list.1.occupation": "Municipal manager and operations manager",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.list.10.occupation": "Business graduate",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.list.11.occupation": "Tradesperson",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.list.12.occupation": "Candidate",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.list.13.bio": "Björgvin Helgason is a farmer and former leader of Hvalfjarðarsveit. He previously served on the municipality's environment, planning, and nature conservation committee and has long been involved in municipal affairs. Björgvin is in 13th place on the A-list of Samhent sveitar for the 2026 municipal elections in Hvalfjarðarsveit.",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.list.13.occupation": "Potato farmer",
  "hvalfjardarsveit.HVA.list.14.occupation": "Candidate",
