  "mulathing.M.list.21.bio": "Björn Ármann Ólafsson is a forest farmer at Meðalnes in Fell in Fljótsdalshérað. He has welcomed guests for forest walks on his land and is active within the Association of Forest Farmers in Austurland. Björn Ármann is in 21st place on the Centre Party's list in Múlaþing for the 2026 municipal elections.",
  "mulathing.M.list.21.occupation": "Forest farmer",
