  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.0.text": "A clear vision for the future and a progressive mindset in the development of Reykjanesbær.",
  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.0.title": "Vision for the future",
  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.1.text": "A strong and diverse business community in Suðurnes — the Beatle town where ideas become reality.",
  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.1.title": "Business and employment",
  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.2.text": "Planning and development for the benefit of residents — the town we want to live in.",
  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.2.title": "Planning",
  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.3.text": "Sustainable development and environmental responsibility in all policymaking.",
  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.3.title": "Sustainability",
  "reykjanesbaer.C.agenda.4.text": "Quality education and strong school services as the foundation of a flourishing nation.",
