  "reykjavik.J.list.2.bio": "Sigrún E. Unnsteinsdóttir is a 69-year-old businesswoman, born on Njálsgata in Reykjavík where she has lived and worked her entire life. She has mostly been self-employed and has four children and eight grandchildren who all live in the city. She sits on the board of FEB (the Association of Senior Citizens in Reykjavík and surrounding area) and is a founding member of the Socialist Party.",
