  "reykjavik.J.list.3.bio": "Hannes Pétursson is a 33-year-old retail worker and lifelong Reykjavík resident. He is in 3rd place on the J-list of the Socialist Party in Reykjavík and focuses on the interests of working people and opposition to the marketization of city services.",
