  "reykjavik.J.list.4.bio": "Geirdís Hanna Kristjánsdóttir is a 51-year-old disability pensioner in 4th place on the J-list of the Socialist Party in Reykjavík. As a person with a disability herself, she focuses on the rights of disabled people in city planning and believes it essential that disabled people and their advocates take part in those decisions. She is also deeply engaged with traffic safety for pedestrians, cyclists and drivers.",
  "reykjavik.J.list.4.interests.0": "Rights of disabled people and disability pensioners",
