  "reykjavik.J.list.5.bio": "Jón Ferdínand Estherarson is a 34-year-old political historian in 5th place on the J-list of the Socialist Party in Reykjavík. He is deputy chair of the Tenants' Union (Leigjendasamtökin) and chair of the Socialist Society of Reykjavík. He has long worked in low-wage jobs and lived on the rental market, which shapes his focus on housing policy from a tenant's perspective.",
  "reykjavik.J.list.5.interests.0": "Housing and tenant associations",
  "reykjavik.J.list.5.interests.1": "Vice-chairman of the Tenants’ Association",
