  "reykjavik.M.list.19.occupation": "Shopkeeper",
  "reykjavik.M.list.2.bio": "Kristín Kolbrún Waage Kolbeinsdóttir is a teacher and educational counsellor. She was previously vice chair of Hvöt, the association of Independence Party women in Reykjavík, and was on the Independence Party's candidate list in the 2024 parliamentary election. In the run-up to the 2026 local elections, she resigned from positions of trust within the Independence Party and joined the Centre Party. She is in 2nd place on the Centre Party's list in Reykjavík for the 2026 city council elections.",
  "reykjavik.M.list.2.occupation": "Teacher, parent adviser; former chair of Hvöt",
  "reykjavik.M.list.20.occupation": "Aircraft technician",
  "reykjavik.M.list.21.occupation": "Former teacher",
