  "reykjavik.M.list.29.occupation": "Managing Director",
  "reykjavik.M.list.3.bio": "Lárus Blöndal Sigurðsson is a managing director with extensive experience in sports organisations, including as managing director of Knattspyrnufélagið Valur. He has criticised the city's treatment of sports clubs and says they have repeatedly been met with rudeness from the city authorities.",
  "reykjavik.M.list.3.interests.0": "Sports affairs and support for sports clubs",
  "reykjavik.M.list.3.interests.1": "Efficiency and operation of the city",
  "reykjavik.M.list.3.occupation": "Managing director",
