  "reykjavik.P.list.2.bio": "Alexandra Briem is a Píratar City Councillor in Reykjavík, born in 1983 and raised in Breiðholt. She has more than eight years of experience in the service of the city and has held roles as chair of the city executive committee and deputy mayor. She serves on the board of Strætó bs.",
  "reykjavik.P.list.2.interests.0": "Digital services and technology",
  "reykjavik.P.list.2.interests.1": "Planning and environmental issues",
  "reykjavik.P.list.2.interests.2": "Transport issues",
  "reykjavik.P.list.2.interests.3": "Transparency and democratic participation",
  "reykjavik.P.list.2.occupation": "City Councillor, chair of the city executive committee, deputy mayor",
  "reykjavik.P.list.20.occupation": "Architect",
  "reykjavik.P.list.21.occupation": "Film director",
  "reykjavik.P.list.22.occupation": "Security guard",
  "reykjavik.P.list.23.occupation": "Musician",
