  "seltjarnarnes.M.list.1.bio": "Skafti Harðarson is a managing director and chairman of Samtök skattgreiðenda, which were founded in 2012. He is the managing director of Innval ehf., a company specializing in services for interior fitting and furniture workshops, and was previously managing director of Gólfefna ehf.-Teppaland. Skafti is one of the founders of Félag frjálshyggjumanna and previously served on the boards of Heimdallur and Vaka, and has long been active in public debate, especially on tax issues and public sector operations. In 2018 he led the independent list Fyrir Seltjarnarnes (the F-list) in the town council elections, and is now the top candidate for Miðflokkurinn on Seltjarnarnes in the 2026 municipal elections.",
