  "skaftarhreppur.D.list.1.bio": "Sveinn Hreiðar Jensson is the hotel manager of Hótel Klaustur in Kirkjubæjarklaustur and a municipal council representative in Skaftárhreppur. He received his education in hotel management in Switzerland and has led the hotel’s operations with an emphasis on local ingredients and cooperation with the local community. Sveinn heads the D-list of the Independence Party and independents in Skaftárhreppur for the 2026 municipal elections.",
