  "skagafjordur.B.list.1.bio": "Einar Eðvald Einarsson is a farmer and managing director from Syðra-Skörðugil in Skagafjörður. He serves on the Skagafjörður municipal council for the B-list of the Progressive Party and leads the Progressive Party list in Skagafjörður for the municipal elections on 16 May 2026.",
