  "skeidagnup.SGE.list.1.bio": "Gunnar Örn Marteinsson is a tourism farmer at Steinsholt in Skeiða- og Gnúpverjahreppur, where he runs a tourism business focused on horseback tours, accommodation, and hiking. He has been active in municipal affairs for decades and served as leader of the municipal council and municipal manager of Skeiða- og Gnúpverjahreppur from 2010 to 2012, including when agreements were signed with Landsvirkjun. He now heads his list for the 2026 municipal elections.",
