  "skeidagnup.SGL.list.1.bio": "Haraldur Þór Jónsson is the mayor of Skeiða- og Gnúpverjahreppur and a farmer at Hraunvellir. He led the Cooperative List (L-list) to a clear majority in the 2022 municipal elections, when the list won three of five council seats, and has served as mayor since then. He has been prominent in discussions on energy issues and tourism in the area, including Búrfellslundur and development in Þjórsárdalur.",
