  "snaefellsbaer.D.agenda.0.text": "Strengthen community and services on Snæfellsnes.",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.agenda.0.title": "Community",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.agenda.1.text": "Boost business and innovation in the area.",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.agenda.1.title": "Employment",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.agenda.2.text": "Sustainable development and protection of the Snæfellsnes nature.",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.agenda.2.title": "Environment",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.list.1.bio": "Auður Kjartansdóttir is the chief financial officer of Fiskmarkaður Íslands and a town councillor in Snæfellsbær. She leads the Independence Party's D-list in Snæfellsbær in the 2026 municipal elections and has previously served on the town council for the party. Auður is chair of the board of Brú pension fund for municipal employees, serves on the board of the National Association of Pension Funds, and sits on the West Iceland Health Committee on behalf of Snæfellsbær for the 2022–2026 term.",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.list.1.occupation": "Mayor",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.list.10.occupation": "Business graduate",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.list.11.occupation": "Tradesperson",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.list.12.occupation": "Lawyer",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.list.13.occupation": "Electrician",
  "snaefellsbaer.D.list.14.occupation": "Service representative",
