  "thingeyjarsveit.THVA.agenda.2.title": "Nature conservation",
  "thingeyjarsveit.THVA.list.1.bio": "Knútur Jónasson is in 1st place on the THVA candidate list in Þórshafnarhreppur in the 2026 municipal elections.",
