  "thingeyjarsveit.THVL.agenda.0.text": "Strengthen a diverse economy and innovation in Þingeyjarsveit.",
  "thingeyjarsveit.THVL.agenda.0.title": "Employment",
  "thingeyjarsveit.THVL.agenda.1.text": "Ensure healthcare services reach all parts of the municipality.",
  "thingeyjarsveit.THVL.agenda.1.title": "Healthcare services",
  "thingeyjarsveit.THVL.agenda.2.text": "Improve transport and telecommunications infrastructure to support residents.",
  "thingeyjarsveit.THVL.agenda.2.title": "Transport",
  "thingeyjarsveit.THVL.list.1.bio": "Hallgrímur Páll Leifsson is a pilot and ski coach and leads the L-list of progress in Þingeyjarsveit in the 2026 municipal elections. The list is a civic candidacy focused on strengthening employment and increasing the population, especially families with children, in the municipality.",
  "thingeyjarsveit.THVL.list.1.interests.0": "Economic development and innovation",
