  "thingeyjarsveit.THVN.list.1.bio": "Eyþór Kári Ingólfsson is an agricultural student living in Úlfsbær in Bárðardalur. He was elected to the municipal council of Þingeyjarsveit on the E-list in 2022, when the list won 5 of 9 seats. He founded a new candidate list, the N-list, for the 2026 elections and leads it as top candidate.",
