  "vogar.VOE.agenda.0.text": "The E-list emphasizes collective strength and solution-oriented work, where all parties come together with the municipality’s interests as their guiding principle.",
  "vogar.VOE.agenda.0.title": "Cooperation across party lines",
  "vogar.VOE.agenda.1.text": "The list wants to continue changing the structure of the administration and the working methods of the town council executive committee and municipal council in order to get a handle on operations.",
  "vogar.VOE.agenda.1.title": "Changed administrative structure",
  "vogar.VOE.agenda.2.text": "After the term, the municipal treasury is back in balance with a positive operating result according to the draft 2025 annual accounts.",
  "vogar.VOE.agenda.2.title": "Sound finances",
  "vogar.VOE.agenda.3.text": "Continued emphasis on strengthening the municipality’s revenue sources and streamlining operations to maintain sustainable finances.",
  "vogar.VOE.agenda.3.title": "Strengthening revenue sources and streamlining",
  "vogar.VOE.list.1.bio": "Birgir Örn Ólafsson is a department manager and president of the municipal council of Sveitarfélagið Vogar. He leads the E-list (Framboðsfélag E-listans) in the 2026 municipal elections and has served on the municipal council during the current term. The list is presented as being made up of people with broad experience in municipal affairs.",
  "vogar.VOE.list.1.interests.0": "municipal affairs",
  "vogar.VOE.list.1.interests.1": "community development",
  "vogar.VOE.list.1.interests.2": "community affairs",
  "vogar.VOE.list.1.occupation": "Department manager, president of the town council",
  "vogar.VOE.list.10.occupation": "Labourer",
  "vogar.VOE.list.11.occupation": "Electrician",
  "vogar.VOE.list.12.occupation": "Primary school teacher, M.Ed. in special education",
  "vogar.VOE.list.13.occupation": "Flight operations officer",
  "vogar.VOE.list.14.occupation": "Candidate",
  "vogar.VOE.list.2.bio": "Eva Björk Jónsdóttir is a department manager and town councillor in Sveitarfélagið Vogar. She is in 2nd place on the E-list (the E-list Candidacy Association) in Vogar for the 2026 municipal elections.",
  "vogar.VOE.list.2.occupation": "Department manager, town councillor",
  "vogar.VOE.list.3.occupation": "Team leader for charging solutions, town councillor",
  "vogar.VOE.list.4.occupation": "Operations manager, deputy town councillor",
  "vogar.VOE.list.5.occupation": "Church caretaker, managing director",
  "vogar.VOE.list.6.occupation": "Electrician, youth centre employee",
  "vogar.VOE.list.7.occupation": "Department manager, specialist in the finance division",
  "vogar.VOE.list.8.occupation": "Preschool assistant",
  "vogar.VOE.list.9.occupation": "Employee at a preschool and sports centre",
  "vogar.VOE.tagline": "Birgir Örn Ólafsson leads the E-list in Vogar — cooperation, solution-oriented work and sound finances",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.0.text": "The L-list wants to strengthen infrastructure, attract businesses, promote business development and reduce debt in order to lower the burden on residents in the long term.",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.0.title": "Strengthen infrastructure and business development",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.1.text": "In the long term, it is possible to lower charges on residents and run the town on a solid foundation with a healthy business sector.",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.1.title": "Lower charges on a solid foundation",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.2.text": "Vogar has grown rapidly, but business development has not kept pace — balance is needed so that revenues are not based solely on charges imposed on residents.",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.2.title": "Growth with balance",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.3.text": "As a town councillor, Kristinn has a duty to prioritize the interests of the whole and keep the municipality running until better solutions are found.",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.3.title": "The interests of the whole",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.4.text": "The next town council — majority and minority alike — must work together for the welfare of the community; that is the key to success.",
  "vogar.VOL.agenda.4.title": "Cooperation in the town council",
  "vogar.VOL.list.1.bio": "Kristinn Björgvinsson is a project manager and municipal councillor of Sveitarfélagið Vogar and leads the L-list (Framfarafélag L-listans) in the 2026 municipal elections. He has served as president of the Vogar municipal council.",
  "vogar.VOL.list.1.interests.0": "municipal affairs",
  "vogar.VOL.list.1.interests.1": "community affairs",
  "vogar.VOL.list.1.interests.2": "community development",
  "vogar.VOL.list.1.occupation": "Project manager",
  "vogar.VOL.list.10.occupation": "Instructor",
  "vogar.VOL.list.11.occupation": "Pensioner",
  "vogar.VOL.list.12.occupation": "BSc Health Engineer",
  "vogar.VOL.list.13.occupation": "Heavy industry technology",
  "vogar.VOL.list.14.occupation": "Candidate",
  "vogar.VOL.list.2.bio": "Eðvarð Atli Bjarnason is a plumbing technician and has worked at Benna Pípari ehf. since 2013. He studied at Fjölbrautaskóli Suðurnesja and graduated from Tækniskólinn in 2017. He has served as an alternate municipal councillor in Sveitarfélagið Vogar since 2019 for the L-list and is in 2nd place on the L-list (Framfarafélag L-listans) in the 2026 municipal elections.",
  "vogar.VOL.list.2.interests.0": "municipal affairs",
  "vogar.VOL.list.2.interests.1": "industry",
