  "vogar.VOL.list.9.occupation": "School support worker",
  "vogar.VOL.tagline": "Kristinn Björgvinsson leads the L-list in Vogar — infrastructure, business development and lower debt",
  "vopnafjordur.VOP.agenda.0.text": "Fisheries and fish processing companies are the foundation of settlement in the municipality.",
  "vopnafjordur.VOP.agenda.0.title": "Fisheries",
  "vopnafjordur.VOP.agenda.1.text": "Promote tourism and protect the unique nature of Vopnafjörður.",
  "vopnafjordur.VOP.agenda.1.title": "Nature and tourism",
  "vopnafjordur.VOP.agenda.2.text": "Ensure good basic services and sufficient housing for all residents.",
  "vopnafjordur.VOP.agenda.2.title": "Services for residents",
  "vopnafjordur.VOP.list.1.bio": "Íris Edda Jónsdóttir is an administrative project manager at Vopnafjarðarhreppur and deputy municipal manager. She has served as secretary for the municipal council and the environment and public works committee, in addition to taking an active part in the work of the compulsory school in Vopnafjörður as a class representative. She leads the Strong Support candidate list in Vopnafjörður for the 2026 municipal elections and was elected unopposed, as it was the only list submitted.",
  "vopnafjordur.VOP.list.1.occupation": "Candidate",
